[style name="bwuh"]
MC (neutral): So, what seems to be the problem?
Random1: {Global.fc_problem}
MC (neutral): {Global.fc_cause_q}
Random1: {Global.fc_cause}
label diagnose_choice
MC (neutral_closed): (Based on what they said, the problem must be...)
- Malware
	if {Global.fc_answer} == 0:
		jump diagnose_correct
	jump diagnose_wrong
- Bloatware
	if {Global.fc_answer} == 1:
		jump diagnose_correct
	jump diagnose_wrong
- System Failure
	if {Global.fc_answer} == 2:
		jump diagnose_correct
	jump diagnose_wrong
label diagnose_wrong
MC (frown): (wait, that isn't quite right...)
set {Global.current_day_score} -= 20
[signal arg="wrong_diagnosis"]
if {Global.current_day_score} <= 0:
	jump diagnose_failed
jump diagnose_choice
label diagnose_failed
Random1: {Global.fc_leave}
[signal arg="day_failed"]
jump timeline_end
label diagnose_correct
MC (smile): Alright, I know what to do. Give me a moment.
[signal arg="start_minigames"]
label timeline_end
